      {
        "id": "3257bbcc-3831-44b1-a343-936da7017577",
        "conversation_id": "1dee7b49-5591-45d4-a85f-fcccfe87ff15",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "You need to fill in the following fields:\n\n1. Applicant's Name\n2. PAN\n3. Initial Subscription Amount\n4. Permanent Address of Subscriber / Guardian\n5. Date of Birth of Minor\n6. Relationship with Minor\n7. CIF NO\n8. A/C NO\n9. Name\n10. Amount\n11. Rupees\n\nAdditionally, ensure the date is filled in the \"Date\" field and provide the required signatures in the \"Signature\" and \"Additional Specimen Signature\" fields.",
